{"path": "/repos/WebDevBooster/richos/issues", "headers": {"authorization": "Bearer walk-stand-in-token-REDACTED", "accept": "application/vnd.github+json", "x-github-api-version": "2022-11-28", "user-agent": "RichOS", "content-type": "application/json", "host": "127.0.0.1:8765", "content-length": "774"}, "body": "{\"body\":\"### What happened\\n\\nWith Text size raised, longer conversation names in the left sidebar are cut off, so they can no longer be read. The user saw it in the \\\\[a company\\\\] conversations, and \\\\[a person\\\\] noticed it too.\\n\\nIn the user's words: The Send button flickers when I press it.\\n\\n### Where\\n\\nThe list of conversations in the left sidebar.\\n\\n### Steps to see it\\n\\n1. Open any conversation.\\n2. In Settings, raise Text size to 135%.\\n3. Look at a long conversation name in the sidebar.\\n\\n### What the user expected\\n\\nEvery conversation name can still be read at any text size.\\n\\n### Version\\n\\nRichOS 1.2.0, development build 35f9203ec \u00b7 macOS 15.7.7 \u00b7 Apple silicon\\n\",\"title\":\"Conversation names in the sidebar are cut off at larger text sizes\"}", "held_s": 22.0}
